[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    Call hierarchy from the source:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    - level 0 (leaf): `printLine`, `printIntLine` → libc `printf`
