[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    library is `printLine`'s `line != NULL` (its false arm is `ERRORS.md` row E1).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 3. **Input shapes** — the only remaining axis, per parameter type:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    - `const char *line`: NULL vs non-NULL; length 0 / 1 / many; content class
